    "note": "Amended May 28, 2026 (later floor votes were on this text; an earlier vote was on the April 9, 2026 text). Section 25010(c)(2) program requirements (instructions, Automated Firearms System updates, destruction/donation after storage period) are omitted for length. Only change in this version vs. earlier: adds \"the provisions and procedures set forth in\" in 25010(c)(2)(D)."
